/E (How We Achieved Our Goals:)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
413 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We began designing the robot at the start of the season, forming partnerships with companies like Autoliv and 3Ddot, which specialize in prototyping and manufacturing. We dedicated countless hours to iterating designs and programming automated systems to maximize performance. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [9]
>>
