808 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (Just like in a normal autonomous routine, our robot is capable of scoring reliably up to 10 specimens on the High Rung in under 40 seconds. This leaves no space for human error while performing repetitive cycles, which tremendously improves our scoring performance during TeleOp. Additionally, this  approach allows the driver to focus more on practicing the non-repetitive, strategic aspects of the match, such as selecting specific samples, delivering them to the human player, high-performance basket scoring, hang positioning, defense etc.)
/E (Just like in a normal autonomous routine, our robot is capable of scoring reliably up to 10 specimens on the High Rung in under 40 seconds. This leaves no space for human error while performing repetitive cycles, which tremendously improves our scoring performance during TeleOp. Additionally, this  approach allows the driver to focus more on practicing the non-repetitive, strategic aspects of the match, such as selecting specific samples, delivering them to the human player, high-performance basket scoring, hang positioning, defense etc.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
