833 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (We implemented Trapezoidal Motion Profiling for the Lift, Extendo and Arm mechanisms because relying solely on PID control \(even when well-tuned\) and raw power signal, resulted in movements that were too abrupt. These sudden accelerations placed unnecessary mechanical stress on the mechanisms . By incorporating Motion Profiling, we regulated maximum velocity and acceleration, achieving smoother motion, reducing mechanical strain, and improving long-term durability.)
/E (We implemented Trapezoidal Motion Profiling for the Lift, Extendo and Arm mechanisms because relying solely on PID control \(even when well-tuned\) and raw power signal, resulted in movements that were too abrupt. These sudden accelerations placed unnecessary mechanical stress on the mechanisms . By incorporating Motion Profiling, we regulated maximum velocity and acceleration, achieving smoother motion, reducing mechanical strain, and improving long-term durability.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
