/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (Unlike a linear control approach, where motor power is directly proportional to joystick input, this function improves precision by creating a smoother transition between low and high speeds. Small joystick movements correspond to finer, more controlled adjustments, while higher speeds are only reached with more significant joystick input. )
