/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (If the human player misplaces a specimen and it is puched away by the Intake, the robot attempts to intake it for 1.5 seconds. If no specimen is detected by the proximity sensor, the extendo retracts for 2 seconds to allow repositioning, then retries to intake. This process repeats for all 4 specimens.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [13]
